WEBVTT

00:00:00.189 --> 00:00:20.118
Watch the complete reel with sound before saving and exporting.

00:00:20.118 --> 00:00:24.294
“Save” keeps the editable project. “Export” creates a separate video file.

00:00:24.294 --> 00:00:38.832
Choose the size, quality and format, then select “Export”. This demonstration saves to a prepared folder.

00:00:38.832 --> 00:00:43.372
The exported video is ready. You can still open the project to make changes.
